     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-background-black-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-background-black-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-background-black-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-CDCREC.html\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>2058-6</td><td>African American</td></tr><tr><td>2068-5</td><td>Barbadian</td></tr><tr><td>2184-0</td><td>Dominican</td></tr><tr><td>2062-8</td><td>Ethiopian</td></tr><tr><td>2071-9</td><td>Haitian</td></tr><tr><td>2072-7</td><td>Jamaican</td></tr><tr><td>2063-6</td><td>Liberian</td></tr><tr><td>2065-1</td><td>Nigerian</td></tr><tr><td>4186-3</td><td>Somali</td></tr><tr><td>2074-3</td><td>Trinidadian</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-background-codes.html\"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-background-codes</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-background-codes.html#ahip-demo-additional-background-codes-9999-5\">9999-5</a></td><td>Angolan</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-background-codes.html#ahip-demo-additional-background-codes-9999-6\">9999-6</a></td><td>Cabo Verdean</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-background-codes.html#ahip-demo-additional-background-codes-9999-7\">9999-7</a></td><td>Congolese</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-background-codes.html#ahip-demo-additional-background-codes-9999-8\">9999-8</a></td><td>Ghanaian</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-background-codes.html#ahip-demo-additional-background-codes-9999-9\">9999-9</a></td><td>Kenyan</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-background-codes.html#ahip-demo-additional-background-codes-9999-10\">9999-10</a></td><td>Sudanese</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is explicitly stated to be 4.0.0\"> version ?4.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html#AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-CNTR\">CNTR</a></td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient has chosen not to respond to this question at this time</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
